  "details": "https://docs.vrchat.com/v2019.2.5/docs/vrc_playeraudiooverride documents an avatar gain limit of -80 as being silent, but when I tested I was able to hear my own avatar (albeit very faintly).\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/v2019.2.5/docs/vrc_playeraudiooverride によると、avatar gain limitが-80で無音になるはずが、実際は自分のアバターをかすかに聞こえた。\n\nTested using world: https://www.vrchat.net/home/world/wrld_03f17561-5b91-4472-90e6-4ef148da2d6b\n\nAnd a pre-beta private avatar: https://www.vrchat.net/home/avatar/avtr_1a3eeaa8-0f7f-4863-91ed-5600fc1e054b (sound enabled by activating the emote switch and using a fingerpoint gesture)",
